<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-CLUB BRUGGE 1 SCHALKE 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CLUB BRUGGE 1 SCHALKE 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Club Brugge of Belgium led Schalke of Germany 1-0 in their UEFA Cup third round first leg match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Mario Stanic 33</p>
</text>
